  LB["Load balancer (WebSocket-capable)"]:::sys
  subgraph N["N identical stateless API instances"]
    direction LR
    I1["Instance 1<br/>HTTP + Socket.io + worker"]:::sys
    I2["Instance 2<br/>HTTP + Socket.io + worker"]:::sys
    I3["Instance N ..."]:::sys
  end
  PG[("PostgreSQL<br/>single source of truth")]:::db

  LB --> I1 & I2 & I3
  I1 & I2 & I3 --> PG

  S1["Correctness never depends on one instance:<br/>• overlaps — exclusion constraint (DB)<br/>• tenant isolation — RLS (DB)<br/>• room cap / last admin — row locks (DB)"]:::note
  S2["Coordination through Postgres, no Redis:<br/>• Socket.io broadcasts — LISTEN/NOTIFY adapter<br/>• outbox jobs — FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED leases<br/>• webhooks — event-id primary key (idempotent)"]:::note
  S3["Stateless auth: JWT verified locally;<br/>refresh tokens in DB (any instance can rotate)"]:::note
  S4["Per-instance only (upgrade path documented):<br/>• rate-limit counters → shared store<br/>• worker could become its own service"]:::note

  PG --- S1
  PG --- S2
  N --- S3
  N --- S4
